{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"tier","value":"authority","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"reliability","value":"CONFIRMED NEGATIVE: building permits is NOT a standard/shared dataset across DataCity cities. Queried Jerusalem, Kfar Saba, Netanya via CKAN search/API - all 0 results for permit terms. Only Jerusalem carries a narrow, stale (last update 2023-10-31), manually-exported TAMA-38 urban-renewal subset - a one-off, not a replicated catalog item. Onboarding one DataCity city does NOT get permits for others. Haifas building-sites dataset is a red herring - it is a re-published NATIONAL data.gov.il / Ministry-of-Labor construction-safety feed, not a permit record.","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"israel_coverage","value":"platform spans Jerusalem, Haifa, Kfar Saba, Netanya, Maale Adummim (+ Beer Sheva as CKAN peer per prior session finding) - list not exhaustive, no master roster page found","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"update_cadence","value":"platform-wide: no fixed cadence; per-dataset, ranges from daily (Haifa buildingsites, itself a national repost) to near-annual manual (Jerusalem TAMA-38)","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"cross_ref_key","value":"varies per dataset; no universal key since no standard permit schema exists","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"sports_filterable","value":"no - moot, no standard permit dataset exists to filter","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"DataCity platform catalog-standardization verdict","field":"access","value":"platform is CKAN-based SaaS (docs.ckan.org compatible API), so IF a city later publishes permits, standard CKAN datastore_search/package_show calls would work uniformly across cities - infra ready even though content is not there","source_key":"datacity.org.il"}
